  "references": [
    {
      "id": "ref_001",
      "text": "I left my keys on the kitchen table again."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_002",
      "text": "She wants to visit her family next month, maybe around the holidays."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_003",
      "text": "The man sent the cup back to us."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_004",
      "text": "They moved into a much bigger house just last spring."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_005",
      "text": "We saw three deer near the river while walking early this morning."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_006",
      "text": "My brother bought a shiny new red car last weekend."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_007",
      "text": "These cheap seats are not very big."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_008",
      "text": "She always drinks her morning coffee black, without any sugar."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_009",
      "text": "Could you please turn off the lights before bed?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_010",
      "text": "She really enjoys speaking both English and a little French."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_011",
      "text": "Could you please pass me the salt and the bottle of water?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_012",
      "text": "The weather looks lovely, so I think we'll go for a long walk later."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_013",
      "text": "He found a nice little apartment downtown, close to his office."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_014",
      "text": "I think we should leave a little early to beat the traffic."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_015",
      "text": "I'd love to grab a coffee after work."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_016",
      "text": "I completely forgot to bring my umbrella again this morning."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_017",
      "text": "We watched a really good film together on Friday night."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_018",
      "text": "Let's meet at that new little place near the park around noon."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_019",
      "text": "They love walking along the beach together almost every evening."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_020",
      "text": "He carefully put all the books back on the shelf."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_021",
      "text": "I'm not sure who edited the final report."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_022",
      "text": "Please close the window before you leave; it's getting really cold."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_023",
      "text": "Do you want to come over this weekend and help me paint the kitchen?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_024",
      "text": "I usually like to read a good book before I fall asleep."
    },
    {
      "id": "ref_025",
      "text": "Don't forget to call your mother back tomorrow, okay?"
    }
  ],
